<p>Yeeks live fast, think fast, and sacrifice fast for the Way.</p><p>Your global speed is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4.0%, 7.2%, 10%, 13%, 15%.</acronym></p><p>If your life is below 30% after taking damage you gain 1.5 turns.  This effect can only happen once every <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">45, 35, 30, 27, 25</acronym> turns.</p>